    "title": "Apple CEO John Ternus says the company won’t ship AI for AI’s sake",
    "summary": "Apple's strategic focus on privacy and user-centric AI could redefine industry standards, emphasizing meaningful innovation over hype.\nThe post Apple CEO John Ternus says the company won’t ship AI for AI’s sake appeared first on Crypto Briefing.",
    "hasSummary": true,
